    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08sp6m8ip490",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c08n1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Begin with medical guidance",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08s2",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08n2",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Discuss new, persistent or worsening nerve symptoms with a healthcare professional. Ask which activities and types of touch are appropriate, whether there are areas to avoid and what changes should prompt further assessment. Bring those instructions to a bodywork appointment.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08s3",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c08n3",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "What massage may offer",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08s4",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08n4",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "When appropriate for your condition, massage can focus on comfort, relaxation and surrounding muscle tension. A chronic low-back pain trial reported benefits for symptoms and function, but that finding does not demonstrate nerve regrowth or apply to every neuropathy or sciatica diagnosis.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08s5",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08n5",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Reduced discomfort during a session should not be interpreted as proof that damaged nerves have healed. The goal and the way progress is assessed should be clear from the start.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08s6",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c08n6",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Pressure and technique should fit the person",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08s7",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08n7",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "More pressure is not automatically more useful. Tell your therapist about reduced sensation and any area where feedback may be unreliable. ",
            "decorations": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Deep tissue massage",
            "decorations": [
              {
                "type": "LINK",
                "linkData": {
                  "link": {
                    "url": "https://www.matrixmassage.net/deep-tissue-massage-salem-wi",
                    "target": "SELF"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": " and ",
            "decorations": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "manual lymphatic drainage",
            "decorations": [
              {
                "type": "LINK",
                "linkData": {
                  "link": {
                    "url": "https://www.matrixmassage.net/manual-lymphatic-drainage-massage-salem-wi",
                    "target": "SELF"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": " are different services; neither should be selected solely because the word “nerve” appears in a symptom description.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08s8",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c08n8",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Where red light fits",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08s9",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08n9",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "You can read about ",
            "decorations": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "red light therapy at Matrix",
            "decorations": [
              {
                "type": "LINK",
                "linkData": {
                  "link": {
                    "url": "https://www.matrixmassage.net/red-light-therapy-salem-wi",
                    "target": "SELF"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": " to understand the wellness service. This article does not establish a panel protocol that remyelinates nerves, restores lost sensation or treats neuropathy. A fixed series of appointments should not be sold on those promises.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08s10",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c08n10",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "Supplements need an individual reason",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08s11",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08n11",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "id": "",
          "nodes": [],
          "textData": {
            "text": "B12 deficiency can affect nerve function, while excess supplemental B6 can cause nerve problems. That makes individualized assessment more useful than a standard combination of B vitamins, alpha-lipoic acid and other products. Review supplements and doses with your clinician or pharmacist.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c08s12",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
